!#We have calculated a potential energy surface of fuel radicals at CBS-QB3 level and calculated the pressure-dependent rate coefficients roughly by using ChemRate software. #
!#By contrasting the simulation results between our calculated rate coefficients and different literature values of high-pressure-limit rate coefficients,                    #
!#we estimated the pressure-dependent rate coefficients for these fuel radicals by choosing literature values approximately to our calculated results.                        #
